<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Every knee shall bow before Him,</l><l>Every tongue confess His name,</l><l>Ransomed myriads shall adore Him,</l><l>Who endured the sinner’s shame!</l><l>From the glory, from the glory,</l><l>God doth now His worth proclaim.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Man, the cross to Him awarded;</l><l>Man, the Savior crucified;</l><l>This world’s judgment stands recorded.</l><l>God’s own justice satisfied!</l><l>By the glory, by the glory,</l><l>Christ was claimed on earth who died.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Son of Man, His incarnation</l><l>Opened first the tale of grace;</l><l>Son of Man, in new creation</l><l>Leader of a chosen race!</l><l>Well may glory, well may glory,</l><l>Give to Him the honored place!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
